   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT in relation to authorizing the county of Nassau assessor to accept an\napplication for a real property tax exemption from St. Gregorios Malankara\nOrthodox Church Queens, Inc.",
    "basePrintNo": "S9061",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S9061-2023",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "",
    "lawSection": "Nassau County",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S9061\n\nSPONSOR: MARTINS\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act in relation to authorizing the county of Nassau assessor to\naccept an application for a real property tax exemption from St. Gregor-\nios Malankara Orthodox Church Queens, Inc.\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nThis legislation authorizes St. Gregorios Malankara Orthodox Church\nQueens Inc, to file for an exemption for real property taxes with\nrespect to the 2021-2022 and 2022-2023 assessment rolls.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 authorizes St. Gregorios Malankara Orthodox Church Queens Inc,\nto file for an exemption for real property taxes with respect to the\n2021-2022 and 2022-2023 assessment rolls for relevant general and school\ntaxes. This is for the property located at 911 N First St. and 915 N\nFirst St., in the Town of North Hempstead, County of Nassau.\n\nSection 2 is the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis legislation would allow St. Gregorios Malankara Orthodox Church\nQueens Inc. to file for an exemption for real property taxes paid for\nparcels that have subsequently been granted an exemption.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNone.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
